From 6bd10d816716042b6dc32f5130f5485a648427a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:45:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Tracy profiler zones: rt_tracy.h, opt-in with build-linux.py
 --tracy (#137)

Zones where perf.c already times: the present (frame mark), nvn submit and its finish wait, shadow sync, write-back
compare and write-back, pipeline binds, texture uploads, the released-texture sweep, the audio mixer frame. Every
macro compiles to nothing without TRACY_ENABLE. The prebuilt client installs crash handlers when a profiler connects;
plat_fault_reinstall puts the runtime's back for 300 presents after each connection.
---
 runtime/audio_mixer.c    |  7 +++++++
 runtime/nvn_api_core.c   | 10 +++++++++-
 runtime/perf.c           |  3 +++
 runtime/platform/linux.c | 20 +++++++++++++++-----
 runtime/rt_tracy.h       | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 runtime/vk_exec_draw.c   |  3 +++
 runtime/vk_memory.c      | 17 +++++++++++++++--
 runtime/vk_texture.c     | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 8 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 runtime/rt_tracy.h

